---
layout: theme
---

{%- style -%}
  .privacy-policy-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: #fff;
  }
  
  .privacy-header {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #f6f6f6;
  }
  
  .privacy-header__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    max-width: 120rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    padding-top: 8rem;
    padding-bottom: 10rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .privacy-header__title {
    font-size: clamp(5rem, 6vw, 7rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-family: avertaDefault, sans-serif;
  }
  
  .privacy-header__features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 3rem;
    max-width: 60rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .privacy-header__feature {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  
  .privacy-header__feature-icon {
    width: 6.4rem;
    height: 6.4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #eaeaea;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }
  
  .privacy-header__feature-icon svg {
    width: 3.2rem;
    height: 3.2rem;
    color: #000;
  }
  
  .privacy-header__feature-text {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #000;
    font-family: avertaDefault, sans-serif;
  }
  
  .privacy-content {
    max-width: 80rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    padding-top: 6rem;
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
  }
  
  .privacy-card {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  
  .privacy-card__content {
    padding: 6rem 4rem;
  }
  
  .privacy-card__date {
    text-align: right;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .privacy-card__date p {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-family: avertaDefault, sans-serif;
  }
  
  .privacy-section {
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }
  
  .privacy-section h2 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-family: avertaDefault, sans-serif;
  }
  
  .privacy-section h3 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #374151;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-family: avertaDefault, sans-serif;
  }
  
  .privacy-section p {
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-family: avertaDefault, sans-serif;
  }
  
  .privacy-section ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 3rem;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-family: avertaDefault, sans-serif;
  }
  
  .privacy-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-family: avertaDefault, sans-serif;
  }
  
  .privacy-section a {
    color: #2b2b2b;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  
  .privacy-section a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  
  .contact-section {
    background: #f9fafb;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 3rem;
  }
  
  .contact-section h2 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-family: avertaDefault, sans-serif;
  }
  
  .contact-section p {
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-family: avertaDefault, sans-serif;
  }
  
  .contact-section a {
    color: #2b2b2b;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  
  .contact-section a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .privacy-header__features {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    
    .privacy-card__content {
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
    }
    
    .privacy-section h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    
    .privacy-section h3 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<div class="privacy-policy-page">
  <!-- Header Banner -->
  <div class="privacy-header">
    <div class="privacy-header__content">
      <h1 class="privacy-header__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      
      <div class="privacy-header__features">
        <div class="privacy-header__feature">
          <div class="privacy-header__feature-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="privacy-header__feature-text">Data Protection</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="privacy-header__feature">
          <div class="privacy-header__feature-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="privacy-header__feature-text">Transparency</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="privacy-header__feature">
          <div class="privacy-header__feature-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="16" r="1"/>
              <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="privacy-header__feature-text">Secure Storage</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="privacy-header__feature">
          <div class="privacy-header__feature-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="privacy-header__feature-text">Your Rights</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="privacy-content">
    <div class="privacy-card">
      <div class="privacy-card__content">
        <div class="privacy-card__date">
          <p>Last updated: November 10, 2025</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="privacy-sections">
          <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>Introduction</h2>
            <p>Welcome to Fineyst LLC ("we," "our," "us").</p>
            <p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you visit or make a purchase on <a href="https://www.fineystjackets.com">https://www.fineystjackets.com</a> ("Site").</p>
            <p>By using our website, you agree to the terms described in this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of our Site.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>We collect personal information that you provide directly and automatically through your interactions with our website.</p>
            
            <h3>Information you provide includes:</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Name</li>
              <li>Email address</li>
              <li>Billing and shipping address</li>
              <li>Phone number</li>
              <li>Account login details</li>
              <li>Payment information (processed securely via Stripe or PayPal)</li>
              <li>Messages sent via our contact form or email</li>
              <li>Product reviews or testimonials</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Information collected automatically includes:</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Device type and browser</li>
              <li>IP address and location data</li>
              <li>Website activity through cookies and similar technologies (Google Analytics, Meta Pixel)</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>We use your personal information to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Process and fulfill orders</li>
              <li>Communicate with you regarding your purchases or support requests</li>
              <li>Send updates, offers, and promotional messages (if subscribed)</li>
              <li>Improve our website, services, and customer experience</li>
              <li>Prevent fraudulent activities and ensure transaction security</li>
              <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
            </ul>
            <p>You may opt out of marketing emails anytime by clicking "Unsubscribe" in our emails.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>Sharing Your Information</h2>
            <p>We do not sell your personal data.</p>
            <p>We only share necessary information with trusted third parties that help us operate our business, including:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Payment processors: Stripe, PayPal</li>
              <li>Shipping providers: FedEx</li>
              <li>Analytics and marketing tools: Google Ads, Meta (Facebook) Ads, Klaviyo</li>
            </ul>
            <p>All third-party partners are bound by data protection agreements and use your data only as required to perform their services.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>Cookies and Tracking</h2>
            <p>We use cookies and tracking technologies to enhance user experience, analyze traffic, and show relevant ads.</p>
            <p>You can manage or disable cookies through your browser settings. Note that disabling cookies may affect certain features of the Site.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>Data Retention</h2>
            <p>We retain your personal data only as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy, unless a longer retention period is required by law.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>Data Security</h2>
            <p>We follow industry-standard measures to protect your personal data, including SSL encryption and secure third-party payment gateways. However, no online system is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute protection.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>Your Rights</h2>
            <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Access, update, or delete your personal information</li>
              <li>Withdraw consent for marketing</li>
              <li>Request data portability</li>
              <li>File a complaint with your local data protection authority</li>
            </ul>
            <p>You can make requests by emailing <a href="mailto:info@fineystjackets.com">info@fineystjackets.com</a>.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>Age Restriction</h2>
            <p>Our website is intended for individuals aged 16 and above. We do not knowingly collect personal information from minors under 16.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>International Data Transfers</h2>
            <p>Since we operate in the US, UK, and Pakistan, your data may be transferred and processed in countries where we or our partners operate. We ensure appropriate safeguards are in place to protect your information during international transfers.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The latest version will always be available on this page with the updated effective date.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="contact-section">
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
            <p>Fineyst LLC</p>
            <p>122 Henderson Rd, Sandy Creek, NY 13145, USA</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@fineystjackets.com">info@fineystjackets.com</a></p>
            <p>Website: <a href="https://www.fineystjackets.com">https://www.fineystjackets.com</a></p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>